# issue: 1361
# red_on: 6c936958; the case is named for a feature while its header names an issue
--- runner
timeout_ms: 10000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem
--- schema
node Person {
    name: String @key
    age: I32
}
--- seed
{"type":"Person","data":{"name":"alice","age":1}}
--- query
query all() { match { $p: Person } return { $p.name } }
--- expect unordered
{"p.name":"alice"}
--- expect shape
p.name: String
